Description: Powerful Tools - desktop utilities for power users
 A free, open-source collection of desktop utilities for Linux:
  * Awake - keep the computer awake without changing power settings
  * Color Picker - pick colors from the screen (HEX, RGB, HSL, HSV, CMYK)
  * Text Extractor - copy text from any part of the screen (OCR)
  * Quick Launcher - apps, files, calculator, commands and web search
  * Bulk Rename - rename many files with regex, case and numbering
  * Image Resizer - batch resize images with presets
  * File Unlocker - see which processes use a file and end them
  * Peek - quick previews of images, text and folders
  * Screen Ruler - measure pixels with edge detection
  * Fancy Zones - arrange 2, 3 or 4 windows from the maximize button
  * Always On Top, Advanced Paste, Keyboard Manager, Shortcut Guide,
    Hosts File Editor, Environment Variables and File Templates
